        If you enjoy Nethack, then VOTE for it!
 
 
        One of the greatest attributes of Nethack is that it 
is ALWAYS there, and it never ceases to amaze me and keep me 
entertained.  Throughout the years (over 8 of them) games have 
come and gone--the entire Ultima series, Wizardry, Sierra 
games, Infocom, flight sims, etc, etc.--but the only game that 
has stayed on my hard drive *EVER SINCE I FIRST DOWNLOADED IT* 
is Nethack.  What Nethack has that all the others fail at, is 
complexity.  It takes, literally, years upon years to try and 
master this game, only then to realize that, because of its 
size and depth, it can never be mastered.  This is the one and 
only game for strategy lovers...and that's why you're here.  
 
 
        So, VOTE for the game.  In the comp.sys.ibm.pc.games.announce
newsgroup there is all the information for voting in Jojo's 
famous "Top 100" list which is posted on a weekly basis.  I've 
been trying to get Nethack higher, but I just can't do it by 
myself, so I thought I'd post this message in case there were 
some hardcore fans out there (like myself) that weren't aware 
of Top 100.  Give it a try.  Help Nethack rise to the TOP!
 
